Against the build it replaces
-----------------------------

The engine_amxx.dll H9 shipped before, from the reTS AMX Mod X build (1.10.0-manual):
203776 bytes, SHA256 C8103AF3D6F7EC0AE954082E0C211A2B7F416FBF9A5A1B02F98E2E92CEF94077,
kept as engine_amxx.dll.bak_slots beside this file. To go back, copy that over engine_amxx.dll.

On servers of 32 slots or fewer nothing changes: the tables are longer, and every loop and
bound in them still stops at the server's maxplayers.
